# Pilldue

Personal local medication refill tracker (.NET 10, Spectre.Console, SQLite).

## Product (v1)

- Config default refill **day of month = 5**; per-med override in DB.
- Med: package size, prescribed package count, daily dosage, stock, prescription ~6 months.
- Flows: stock vs next/second refill day; refill by packages; skip-dose stock bump; calendar (last covered + prescription end).
- Out: pharmacy/doctor contacts, dose reminders, multi-user/cloud.
- Details: [docs/use-cases.md](docs/use-cases.md)

## Solution

- Projects: `Pilldue.Business` (domain + ports + in-memory fakes), `Pilldue.Data` (**EF Core + SQLite** migrations + config file), `Pilldue.UI` (composition + TUI).
- Deps: UI → Business, UI → Data, Data → Business (DIP).
- Tests under `tests/`; integration tests = multi-step scenarios, no UI.
- Persistence: EF Core only for v1 DB access — no Dapper/ADO.
- Last-covered rule: inclusive (`asOf + floor(stock/dosage) - 1`); calendar gaps use real month lengths.

## Conventions

- Update `docs/` when decisions change.
- UI thin: call Business only; no SQL or refill math in UI.
- Persistence and config file I/O only in Data.
- Prefer small PRs mapped to GitHub issues; do not change port signatures without a contracts follow-up.
